        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e68b1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-03T15:43:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"lynkfox\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/48/1997_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> lynkfox:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thats how I read it as well. Because the card isn't Limited, and it says&nbsp;<em>a</em> card, I also say it double stacks for having multiple Criticals in play&nbsp;The Trigger is discarding a card. Doesn't matter why, how, or when - anything that forces you to discard will trigger critical multiplier, each time you discard a card.&nbsp;&nbsp;Which makes Citizen Sweat cry a little inside.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I agree with this and would also say that each bonus can go to a different person.&nbsp; So for example if I have to Criticals in play and Recompile discarding three cards I have a total of +6 to hand out in any combination.&nbsp; Maybe I give my self a +1 so my power is strong enough to kill something then I give the next hero a +2, then the last hero gets a +3.</p>",
